    <item>
      <title>两位西班牙主帅北伦敦献上英超宣传片级对决</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E4%B8%A4%E4%BD%8D%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99%E4%B8%BB%E5%B8%85%E5%8C%97%E4%BC%A6%E6%95%A6%E7%8C%AE%E4%B8%8A%E8%8B%B1%E8%B6%85%E5%AE%A3%E4%BC%A0%E7%89%87%E7%BA%A7%E5%AF%B9%E5%86%B3/</link>
